{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CfbWNj5HmctAqnGRuD9Bp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"VERDICT: CHANGES\n\n- P2 src/backends/claude/mod.rs:~205 — The auto-mode refusal criterion is only met synthetically. The test asserts `permission_denials.is_empty()` for every fixture, including `auto-refusal*` and `auto-refusal-exfil`. No test pins how the real recorded refusal parses or finalizes. Fix: add a fixture-specific assertion for what `auto-refusal*.stdout` actually yields (status, text, `is_error`). If the refusal only appears in the text, document that and map it to a concern.\n- P2 src/backends/claude/mod.rs:~46 — `argv` generates the `--session-id` uuid internally, and nothing records it. A cancelled or killed run has no `result` line, so `session_id` is `None` (the `cancelled` fixture test asserts this). That job cannot be resumed. #17 says the id is \"chosen before launch\", which implies it is kept. Fix: generate the uuid in the caller or spawn, and store it on the job as the session.\n- P3 src/cli_info.rs, src/doctor.rs — The hard-coded `[\"cursor\",\"claude\"]` list is duplicated in both files. Fix: use one `Backend::ALL` constant.\n- P3 tests/live.rs — `real_claude()` duplicates `claude::resolve_bin`. Fix: reuse it, or accept the duplication because it is an integration test.\n- P3 tests/budgets.rs — The `DOCTOR_BUDGET_MS` increase from 567 to 2500 is about 4x the observed 649ms. It will hide regressions. Fix: set it near 1000.\n\nSTATUS: DONE"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1218,"cache_read_input_tokens":48125,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1218},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4eeac212-2355-47f7-94b7-850a7e176ccd","uuid":"df0c3a42-e3bd-4a16-9c0f-2d66308baeca","timestamp":"2026-10-01T12:20:56.978Z","request_id":"req_011CfbWNihDMjFMkiGs1bUwP"}
